<title>UK: Sime denies plans to buy L&amp;G stake.</title>
<headline>Sime denies plans to buy L&amp;G stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified conglomerate Sime Darby Bhd on Friday denied a press report that it was negotiating the purchase of a stake in Land and General Bhd .</p>
<p>&quot;Sime Draby Berhad wishes to advise that it has not entered into any negotiations with any party regarding the purchase of a stake in Land and General Berhad,&quot; Sime Darby said in reaction to a report in Singapore's Business Times.</p>
<p>Sime Darby added it was not in talks to sell its 60.35 percent stake in United Malayan Banking Corporation Berhad either.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
